  "description": "\"I'll be your girlfriend, Doctor.\"\n\nKang Jia has been secretly in love for three years with Gi Tae-oh — a genius in cardiothoracic surgery and blessed with a face to match. She's been enjoying a blissful hospital intern life just watching the man she adores... until one day, she hears he's going on a blind date. Eavesdropping at the venue, she overhears something shocking…!\n\n“If that's the reason, then I can't give up on you, Doctor.”\n\n“…That reason?”\n\n“I-I mean… even if you're, um, impotent… it doesn’t matter to me. I’ve liked you for a long time.”\n\nHe doesn’t say a word. Only the soft hum of classical music fills the lounge through the silence.\n\n“Ha… this is crazy.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n*R19:* [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66875633), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A7%9D%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91-%EB%A7%9E%EC%84%A0-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4529)    \n*R15:* [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/66875816)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n*R19:* [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/188442)    \n*R15:* [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/188441)",
